a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le05ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Offering Advice and Solutions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you work in a restaurant or in a shop, it is important to offer advice and solutions properly.<Br><br>Remember to offer advice politely and to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to propose a solution."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions:<br><br> <ul><li>You might want to ... </li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>You should ... </li> <li>You ought to ... (strong request)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding Politely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <ul><li>You might want to ...</li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>You should ... </li> <li>You ought to ... (strong request)</li> <li> ... don't you think?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I understand, but ... </li> <li>I'm afraid not</li> <li>I apologize, but ... </li> <li>Here's what I think you could do</li> <li>That sounds reasonable</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I had to deal with angry patrons yesterday. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: You really need to be more thick-skinned, dear! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I suppose you're right."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Being Persuasive"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you work in a restaurant or a shop, it is important to be persuasive to be able to change a customer's mind about something.<br><br>Remember to be polite and use appropriate expressions to persuade someone."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Don't you agree ... ?</span> to convince or persuade someone to change their minds.<br><br>You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">You sound like ... </span> and use modals like <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">would rather</span> to suggest what is necessary. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Sometimes my clients are so difficult! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I know, but happy customers would make your job easier, don't you think?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "patron"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a regular customer at a restaurant or store "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your loud conversation is bothering other patrons."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le05ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "floor staff"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "employees who works in a restaurant, setting and cleaning tables  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We train our floor staff to deal with difficu